  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.15: Raise the author-period portfolio envelope from 64 repositories / 128 pinned heads to 256 repositories / 512 pinned heads while retaining bounded repository execution, caches, queues, checkpoints, output, and emergency safety limits. GitHub-assisted workspace discovery now continues past malformed .git markers to find valid descendant checkouts while preserving actionable fail-closed ownership and readability diagnostics. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.15/CHANGELOG.md",
